{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyMW89FujqMeqJTxKdh0sDZa"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Lab 16 – Database Design and Queries: Schema Design and SQL\n","Generation"],"metadata":{"id":"ap_zttd8NZHu"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task Description #1 – Schema Generation"],"metadata":{"id":"Y2-VVbakNcKW"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task: Ask AI to design a schema for a Library Management System\n","(Tables: Books, Members, Loans)."],"metadata":{"id":"7-8R-xMhNrSO"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["PROMPT : design a schema for a library management system where the tables are books, members, loans"],"metadata":{"id":"Fer13WkINvH-"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"bfd62567"},"source":["Here's a possible schema for a library management system with tables for `books`, `members`, and `loans`:\n","\n","**`books` table:**\n","\n","- `book_id` (Primary Key, Integer): Unique identifier for each book.\n","- `title` (VARCHAR): The title of the book.\n","- `author` (VARCHAR): The author of the book.\n","- `available_copies` (Integer): Number of available copies for loan.\n","\n","**`members` table:**\n","\n","- `member_id` (Primary Key, Integer): Unique identifier for each member.\n","- `first_name` (VARCHAR): The member's first name.\n","- `last_name` (VARCHAR): The member's last name.\n","- `address` (VARCHAR): The member's address.\n","- `phone_number` (VARCHAR): The member's phone number.\n","- `email` (VARCHAR): The member's email address.\n","- `membership_date` (DATE): The date the member joined the library.\n","\n","**`loans` table:**\n","\n","- `loan_id` (Primary Key, Integer): Unique identifier for each loan.\n","- `book_id` (Foreign Key, Integer): References the `book_id` in the `books` table.\n","- `member_id` (Foreign Key, Integer): References the `member_id` in the `members` table.\n","- `loan_date` (DATE): The date the book was loaned out.\n","- `due_date` (DATE): The date the book is due to be returned.\n","- `return_date` (DATE): The actual date the book was returned (can be NULL if not returned yet).\n","- `status` (VARCHAR): The current status of the loan (e.g., 'borrowed', 'returned', 'overdue').\n","\n","**Relationships:**\n","\n","- One book can have many loans (one-to-many relationship between `books` and `loans`).\n","- One member can have many loans (one-to-many relationship between `members` and `loans`).\n","\n","This schema provides a basic structure for managing books, members, and loans in a library system. You can further expand on this by adding more tables for things like authors, publishers, fines, reservations, etc., depending on the complexity of the system you need."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task Description #2 – Error Insert Data"],"metadata":{"id":"s39ZxWKEOBBu"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task: Ask AI to generate INSERT INTO queries for the schema above\n","(3 sample records per table)."],"metadata":{"id":"ZLZ6rYdbOErW"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["PROMPT : genarate insert into queries for the above schema with atleast 3 sample values"],"metadata":{"id":"AUjvqNLoO98e"}},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"4b43d12e"},"source":["-- Insert data into the books table\n","INSERT INTO books (book_id, title, author, available_copies) VALUES\n","(1, 'The Hitchhiker''s Guide to the Galaxy', 'Douglas Adams', 5),\n","(2, 'Pride and Prejudice', 'Jane Austen', 3),\n","(3, '1984', 'George Orwell', 2);\n","\n","-- Insert data into the members table\n","INSERT INTO members (member_id, first_name, last_name, address, phone_number, email, membership_date) VALUES\n","(101, 'Arthur', 'Dent', '42 Wallaby Way', '555-1234', 'arthur.dent@example.com', '2023-01-15'),\n","(102, 'Elizabeth', 'Bennet', 'Longbourn', '555-5678', 'elizabeth.b@example.com', '2023-02-20'),\n","(103, 'Winston', 'Smith', 'Airstrip One', '555-8765', 'winston.s@example.com', '2023-03-10');\n","\n","-- Insert data into the loans table\n","INSERT INTO loans (loan_id, book_id, member_id, loan_date, due_date, return_date, status) VALUES\n","(1001, 1, 101, '2023-04-01', '2023-04-15', NULL, 'borrowed'),\n","(1002, 2, 102, '2023-04-05', '2023-04-19', '2023-04-18', 'returned'),\n","(1003, 3, 103, '2023-04-10', '2023-04-24', NULL, 'borrowed');"],"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task Description #3 – Basic Queries"],"metadata":{"id":"JJEltdPPPMqV"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task: Use AI to generate a query to list all books borrowed by a specific\n","member"],"metadata":{"id":"5fPC60x0PfC9"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["PROMPT : generate a query to list all the books borrowed by a certain member"],"metadata":{"id":"o0gwoddQQVZc"}},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"98440c1a"},"source":["SELECT\n","    b.title,\n","    b.author,\n","    l.loan_date,\n","    l.due_date\n","FROM\n","    loans l\n","JOIN\n","    books b ON l.book_id = b.book_id\n","WHERE\n","    l.member_id = [member_id]; -- Replace [member_id] with the actual member ID"],"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task Description #4 – Update and Delete Queries"],"metadata":{"id":"IqZewPjhQcrs"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Task: Generate queries with AI for:\n","• Updating a book’s availability to FALSE when borrowed.\n","• Deleting a member record safely."],"metadata":{"id":"lvOyzNXsQxy0"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["PROMPT : Generate queries with AI for: • Updating a book’s availability to FALSE when borrowed. • Deleting a member record safely"],"metadata":{"id":"sgPXTYaXV_Ko"}},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"0298fae6"},"source":["-- Query to update a book's availability when borrowed\n","UPDATE books\n","SET available_copies = available_copies - 1 -- Assuming available_copies is decremented when borrowed\n","WHERE book_id = [book_id]; -- Replace [book_id] with the ID of the borrowed book"],"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"b27b6988"},"source":["-- Query to safely delete a member record\n","-- This is a basic delete. For a truly \"safe\" deletion in a production system,\n","-- you would typically need to handle related records in the 'loans' table first\n","-- (e.g., setting their member_id to NULL if allowed, archiving, or deleting them).\n","DELETE FROM members\n","WHERE member_id = [member_id]; -- Replace [member_id] with the ID of the member to delete"],"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"ExrvZCjZQmTc"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]}]}